    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math challenging but fascinating. Growing up without strong math support at home, I struggled with concepts like calculus. Now, I see it as a tool for problem-solving, especially in chemistry and biology. I’m still learning, but I appreciate how it connects to real-world applications.",
